('r-cr-college-wording-rule-yes-sam-2026-11-19','decision','Sam: yes on the college wording rule for the 36 CR groups','Sam Lee, 2026-11-19 12:42 PM PT, in his words, relayed by COBIx on #3566 (comment 7021717277): "Forward all your recommendations and yes on the 36." A yes to the college wording rule for the 36 Common CR Reference groups an official C-ID number reaches with a title that shares no word with the colleges'' wording (POST Basic Academy "Physical Training and Health Education" on AJ 110; "Racial Issues and the Police" on AJ 160): keep the colleges'' wording as the group''s name and flag the course-number link for a check, never applied. Written as 36 confirmed rows in cr_reference_decisions under updated_by cr-wording-s687@bot (receipt kb/receipts/cr_reference_decisions_2026-11-19_s687_wording_rule.json). "Forward all your recommendations" is also a go on the rest of #3566''s asks (right landing, a way back, live wiring, slash titles once as decided, held titles done and awaiting the fold, #collect aligned with Commons).',array['common-cr-reference','commons','sam-ruling','s687'],'proposed','Sam Lee, 2026-11-19 12:42 PM PT, relayed by COBIx on #3566','Sam Lee',now(),'SkyPipit (S687)','2026-11-19')
